Derived material in this tree
-----------------------------

Portions of KineRouter are direct ports of 9Router source files, translated to
Go but preserving behaviour, wire formats, database schema, file layout and
provider quirks:

  - provider registry and model catalogue      <- open-sse/providers/registry/, config/providerModels.js
  - request/response translators               <- open-sse/translator/
  - executors and provider quirks              <- open-sse/executors/
  - RTK / Headroom / PXpipe token savers       <- open-sse/rtk/, src/lib/headroom/, src/lib/pxpipe/
  - OAuth flows and token refresh              <- src/lib/oauth/, src/app/api/oauth/
  - MiniMax Code auth-lease protocol           <- open-sse/services/minimaxCodeLease.js
  - dashboard UI, routes and copy              <- src/app/, src/shared/, src/components/

